  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "談判與溝通",
    "sub_ename": "NEGOTIATION AND PERSUASION",
    "describe_ch": "從歷史的經驗來看，沒有溝通就沒有社會的形成。從溝通、衝突、折衝、協議到行動上的協調，這一系列的過程統稱為談判。本課程將從對溝通的理解，引入對衝突意涵的探討。在瞭解衝突的價值意涵之後，才能進一步透過探討雙方或多方各自主觀的衝突結構，決定折衝的方式和程序，說服對方接受你所預期的價位，以達成協議。",
    "describe_eh": "Historically, communication is the essential means to construct a society. The process from communications、conflicts、log-rolling、compromise to reach agreement would be an essential process for human surviving and that is defined as \"Negotiation\". This course will explore contents of communication and conflict-solving, and then help students design procedures of log-rolling. Finally, it will also help them to learn the way of persuasion based on the procedure to reach agreement.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "分析溝通的意涵\t",
      "describe_en": "Analyze the meaning of communication."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "綜合談判的理論與知識，適當管理衝突，建構和諧關係 　\t",
      "describe_en": "Management of conflicts and construction of harmonious society through synthesis the exploiting theory and knowledge of negotiation　"
    }
